god_foreknows	one
foreseen_happens	one
free_will	one
impious_to_deny	one
# foreseen_happens: the doubt lies in where "necessarily" (P1) and "possibly" (P2, A1) apply, not in any word of the claim. That is the classic necessity of the consequence versus necessity of the consequent. The claim's own content, that what is foreseen comes to pass, means the same in every statement.
